  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-hanlanying-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳郡<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-hanlanying-wyd:p001:m0002" ref="8k5_lxv_2s6">韓蘭英</persName>婦人有文辭宋孝武世獻中興賦被賞入宮明帝世用為宮中職僚世祖以為博士教六宮書學以其年老多識呼為韓公</p>
